      "type": "content",
      "key": "uitleg",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "html": "<h3>Taak data via ZAC_taak_gegevens</h3><p>The same mechanism with the taak as its source: <code>ZAC_VELD</code> for the path, <code>ZAC_FORMAAT</code> for the formatting. These properties are read straight off the Flowable task, so there is no copy that can go stale. The last row is a deliberate mistake, naming the taak as the source rather than the zaak.</p>"
